124
00:07:56,980 --> 00:08:01,780
Okay, and so then we need to simply update the recipe view.

125
00:08:01,780 --> 00:08:05,850
And by now what we will do is to actually simply overwrite

126
00:08:05,850 --> 00:08:07,760
